---
import Layout from '../Layout.astro';
import { u } from '../../../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="找不到這一頁" page="404">
  <section class="wrap nf">
    <div class="nf-digits" data-stage aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="nf-d c-y" data-drag>4</span>
      <span class="nf-d c-p" data-drag>0</span>
      <span class="nf-d c-b" data-drag>4</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="nf-title">這一頁不見了</h1>
    <p class="nf-lead">可能網址打錯，或是這頁已經搬家。數字可以拖著玩，玩夠了就回首頁吧。</p>
    <div class="nf-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-y btn-lg" href={u('/')}>回首頁</a>
      <a class="btn btn-w btn-lg" href={u('/projects/')}>看作品</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
